# Golden fixtures are byte-exact DataContractSerializer output.
#
# The repository root .gitattributes sets `* text=auto`, which would normalise line endings on
# checkout. DataContractSerializer escapes \n inside attribute values as &#xA; but leaves a raw
# 0x0A byte inside element text, so any corpus type holding a string with a newline would be
# rewritten on Windows checkout and silently fail a byte comparison that passes on Linux.
#
# Treat every fixture as binary so git never touches the bytes.
* -text
